              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bimenyekana mu batuye i Yerusalemu bose, ni cyo cyatumye iyo sambu mu rurimi rwabo bayita Akeludama, risobanurwa ngo “Isambu y'amaraso.”)",
          "type": "text",
